---
[v1] net: dsa: mt7530: fix VLAN deletion to override the FID

Fix mt7530_hw_vlan_del() to explicitly set FID(FID_BRIDGED) when
updating a VLAN entry that still has port members after deletion.
---
v1: fix VLAN deletion to override the FID
---

From e149e7a8be6ac45566db9334524d14d60963d873 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "neal.yen" <neal.yen@mediatek.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:30:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: fix VLAN deletion to override the FID


diff --git a/drivers/net/dsa/mt7530.c b/drivers/net/dsa/mt7530.c
index d127549..282f8fb 100644
--- a/drivers/net/dsa/mt7530.c
+++ b/drivers/net/dsa/mt7530.c
@@ -1770,7 +1770,7 @@ mt7530_hw_vlan_del(struct mt7530_priv *priv,
 
 	if (new_members) {
 		val = IVL_MAC | VTAG_EN | PORT_MEM(new_members) |
-		      VLAN_VALID;
+		      FID(FID_BRIDGED) | VLAN_VALID;
 		mt7530_write(priv, MT7530_VAWD1, val);
 	} else {
 		mt7530_write(priv, MT7530_VAWD1, 0);
-- 
2.45.2

